# Agent scratch (screenshots, local databases) - never part of the app.
# Every pattern here is anchored with a leading slash on purpose: in ignore-file
# syntax a bare "*.png" matches at ANY depth, which would hide every logo and PWA
# icon in wangari-next/public/ from git. It did exactly that until this was fixed.
/.freebuff/
audit-shots/
agent/
/*.png
/login-attempt.png
/waadmin-overview-desktop.png

